{"id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-godel-code.md","title":"Decidable Coding of Modal Syntax","display":"df-modal-godel-code — Decidable Coding of Modal Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-godel-code","aliases":["89-df-modal-godel-code"],"display":"df-modal-godel-code — Decidable Coding of Modal Syntax","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-godel-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-godel-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-godel-code — Decidable Coding of Modal Syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>，字母的指标互异；公式采用既有自由构造子。</li>\n<li>递归子句中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,k,a,b,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,k,a,b,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star_{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\star_{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为固定非法码返回标记。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\Box}\">\\(g_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下文引入的编码、解码和合法码集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是下文引入的自然数配对函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 指通常有限程序可计算；这里的自然数运算在元层使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}godel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\ng_{\\Box}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;g_{\\Box}(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq5i+1,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+2,&amp;g_{\\Box}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+3,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq5\\pi(g_{\\Box}(A),g_{\\Box}(B))+4,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\cup\\{\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq p_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+2)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\neg\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+3)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\Box\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5\\pi(a,b)+4)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b),&amp;\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star_{\\Box}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega:\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))&amp;=A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}=g_{\\Box}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}],\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(g_{\\Box})\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box})\n\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}godel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\ng_{\\Box}&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq0,&amp;g_{\\Box}(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq5i+1,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+2,&amp;g_{\\Box}(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+3,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq5\\pi(g_{\\Box}(A),g_{\\Box}(B))+4,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\cup\\{\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq p_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+2)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\neg\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+3)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\Box\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&amp;\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5\\pi(a,b)+4)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b),&amp;\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k)&amp;\\coloneqq\\star_{\\Box}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega:\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))&amp;=A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}=g_{\\Box}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}],\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Comp}(g_{\\Box})\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box})\n\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此数值编码是本库规约，依据原书 pp.1–6 的有限模态句法与有效证明讨论；不是 Boolos 的原符号或第 2 章算术公式编码。所有构造参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 取模态公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,k,a,b\">\\(i,k,a,b\\)</span> 取自然数。</p>\n<p>Cantor 配对是双射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\le\\pi(a,b)\">\\(a,b\\le\\pi(a,b)\\)</span>。可在有界的对角线中搜索唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>。解码的每次递归参数严格小于输入码，因此全部分支良基，且包括所有非法输入。结构归纳给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))=A\">\\(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))=A\\)</span>，从而编码单射；对数值输入归纳又给合法时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_{\\Box}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n))=n\">\\(g_{\\Box}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n))=n\\)</span>。这些结论证明显示的像等式、总可计算性及合法码可判定性。</p>\n<p>仅有“可计算单射”不足以保证定理码集合可判定。本接口同时给有效解码与可判定像；之后先排除非法码，再判定公式。其他算法可选同样具有可判定像和可计算解码的标准有限树编码，不要求其数值恰等于本规约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"i,k,a,b,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\star_{\\Box}\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}godel\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi(a,b)&\\coloneqq\\frac{(a+b)(a+b+1)}2+b\\quad(a,b\\in\\omega),\\\\\ng_{\\Box}&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\omega,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq0,&g_{\\Box}(p_i)&\\coloneqq5i+1,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+2,&g_{\\Box}(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq5g_{\\Box}(A)+3,\\\\\ng_{\\Box}(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq5\\pi(g_{\\Box}(A),g_{\\Box}(B))+4,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}&:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\cup\\{\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(0)&\\coloneqq\\bot,&\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+1)&\\coloneqq p_k,\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+2)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\neg\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k+3)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\Box\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k),&\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(k)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5\\pi(a,b)+4)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b),&\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(a)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\land\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(b)\\ne\\star_{\\Box},\\\\\\star_{\\Box},&\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(5k)&\\coloneqq\\star_{\\Box}\\quad(k\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{n\\in\\omega:\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)\\ne\\star_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))&=A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}=g_{\\Box}[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}],\\\\\n&\\operatorname{Comp}(g_{\\Box})\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box})\n\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(n\\mapsto\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}}(n)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"i,k,a,b","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\le\\pi(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(g_{\\Box}(A))=A","display":false},{"tex":"g_{\\Box}(\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n))=n","display":false}],"bytes":3385,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"为 GL 定理码集合提供可判定合法码和总解码；区分模态句法编码与一阶算术编码。见 [[89-df-modal-godel-code]]。"},{"id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner=g_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathbb N$ is the modal coding from [[89-df-modal-godel-code]]; its image $\\mathrm{Code}_{\\Box}$ is decidable and $\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}$ is total computable."},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数输入的判定接口：[[89-df-modal-godel-code]] → [[89-df-gl-decidability]] → [[89-thm-gl-decidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}